# Realtime (server)

- JWT in `handshake.auth.token`. Missing token ⇒ `isOfflineMode` + offline handlers only.
- Online: `join_room` is a `boardId` string. Relay `signal` `{ to, signal }`. Emit `room_joined`, `peer_joined`, `peer_left`, `peer_mic_updated`.
- Offline: `create_room` / `join_room` `{ roomCode, userName }`. Room key `offline_${roomCode}`.
- Do not dump full board state through Socket.IO. Signaling only. Persist ops via REST `/operations`.
- Rooms are in-memory. Do not assume they survive process restart.
